        {
            "block_label": "formula",
            "block_content": "\\begin{aligned}&r_{u}\\times\\mathrm{Area}(\\mathrm{Sector}\\mid)=V_{v}\\left(\\frac{3L-X}{2}\\right)+\\frac{2}{3}V_{v}\\frac{X}{2}\\\\ &13.15\\left(\\frac{3\\times240-116}{2}\\right)\\times116=V_{v}\\left(\\frac{3\\times240-116}{2}\\right)+\\frac{2}{3}V_{v}\\frac{116}{2}\\\\ &V_{v}=\\frac{460,670.2}{340.67}=1352.3\\mathrm{Ibs/in}\\\\ \\end{aligned}",
