            "block_content": "\\begin{aligned}&V_{uv}=V_{v}\\frac{3L-X}{2}+\\frac{2}{3}V_{v}\\left(\\frac{X}{2}-d_{v}\\right)\\\\ &=1352.3\\left[\\frac{3\\times240-116}{2}+\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\frac{116}{2}-10.25\\right)\\right]=451.443\\mathrm{~lb}\\\\ \\end{aligned}",
            "block_bbox": [
