            "block_content": "v_{u V}=\\frac{V_{u V}}{\\left(\\frac{3L}{2}-d\\right)d_{V}}=\\frac{451.443}{\\left(\\frac{3\\times240}{2}-10.25\\right)10.25}=125.9\\mathrm{~ps}",
