        {
            "block_label": "formula",
            "block_content": "\\begin{aligned}&v_{c}=1.9(f_{c}^{\\prime})^{1/2}+2500p\\quad(\\mathrm{Equ})\\\\&v_{cv}=1.9(4000)^{1/2}+2500(0.0031)=127.9\\mathrm{psi}>125.9\\mathrm{psi}\\\\ \\end{aligned} ation 4-23)",
